        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Both flexor forearms have multiple 1–3 cm poorly demarcated erythematous, slightly raised, dry patches/thin plaques with excoriations. Anterior neck and upper chest have scattered small erythematous papules/patches of similar appearance."
      }
    },
